  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Faceless God — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level, you have learned to expand your domain. At initiative 20, all creatures of your choice within your domain gains 5% <em>Mental Corruption</em>. Creatures gain a -1 penalty to all rolls for every 10% <em>Mental Corruption</em> they have while within your domain.</p>",
